# Key-registry migration artifacts — these contain LIVE API key values.
# Pattern is deliberately broad: an earlier `.seed-*` form missed the
# generated `.seed.sql` (no hyphen), leaving 33 live keys untracked but
# committable in a public repo.
/scripts/.seed*

